          <fr:mainmatter><html:p>Hello 👋</html:p><html:p>I am a first-year PhD student at <fr:link href="/cmu/" title="Carnegie Mellon University" uri="https://brumal.net/cmu/" display-uri="cmu" type="local">CMU</fr:link> studying <html:strong>mathematical logic</html:strong>, viz. <fr:link href="https://brumal.net/todo/" type="external">homotopy type theory</fr:link>.</html:p><html:p>I am a happy <html:strong><fr:link href="/linux/" title="https://brumal.net/linux/" uri="https://brumal.net/linux/" display-uri="linux" type="local">Linux</fr:link></html:strong> terminal user, rely on <fr:link href="https://git-scm.com/" type="external">Git</fr:link> and <fr:link href="https://www.vim.org/" type="external">Vim</fr:link> for just about everything, and manage my packages with <fr:link href="https://nixos.org/" type="external">Nix</fr:link>.</html:p><html:p>In March 2023, I graduated with a BS in <html:strong>mathematics</html:strong> from <fr:link href="https://caltech.edu/" type="external">Caltech</fr:link>. I am a member of <fr:link href="https://dabney.caltech.edu/" type="external">Dabney House</fr:link>.</html:p><html:p>Last I updated this line, I was <html:strong>reading</html:strong> <fr:link href="/jamessacorey-2012-caliban/" title="Caliban's War" uri="https://brumal.net/jamessacorey-2012-caliban/" display-uri="jamessacorey-2012-caliban" type="local">Caliban's War</fr:link>.</html:p><html:p><html:em>Click collapsed trees to expand...</html:em></html:p>
    
